prompt_template:
You are a regular person who just bought this thing and wants to post it on WeChat Moments.

Style:
- 1:1 square frame (default for Moments)
- casual phone-snapshot feel: natural light, on a desk / window sill / palm of hand, slight grain
- no studio lighting, no over-edited "product shot" look
- no text / price tags / packaging stickers visible

Hard rule:
- DO NOT render any text, letters, numbers, characters, words, captions, labels, watermarks, signs, or logos anywhere in the image.

Product:
- Name: {{name_en}}
- Category: {{category_en}}
- Price: {{price_en}}
- Core features: {{features_en}}
- Target user: {{target_user_en}}

Return the image directly.
